					"content": "清理好了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000502,
					"content": "还没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220000503,
					"content": "#快去清理吧，这可是{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}改邪归正的好机会喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000504,
					"content": "喂，我说啊，做一下清洁工作就能成好人了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿飞"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000505,
					"content": "只要愿意去做好事，那就是好人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000506,
					"content": "这也太简单了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿飞"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000507,
					"content": "做了好事，就是好人，做了坏事，就是坏人，就这么简单。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000508,
					"content": "哼，你说是简单，但如果这么简单，那天下哪里还有坏人呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿飞"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000509,
					"content": "因为天下的所有事都是说起来容易，做起来难。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000510,
					"content": "而坏事做起来，总是比好事容易的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000511,
					"content": "这也是北斗姐姐教你的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220000512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿飞"
				},
				{
					"id": 220000512,
					"content": "是我从书里看的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				}
			]
